  bs_aggr_nick:"Maximal Accumulation", bs_aggr_blurb:"High conviction",
  bs_cons_phil:"Improve on classic DCA with almost zero change to your regular cash flow. You never sit in cash \u2014 you simply buy a little more when the risk metric says value is good. Perfect for salary earners who want a set-it-and-forget-it improvement without needing large reserves.",
  bs_mod_phil:"Concentrate your buying power in genuinely good value zones. You deliberately save during neutral/high-risk periods so you have dry powder ready when risk drops, then buy more aggressively as the reading falls into better bands.",
  bs_aggr_phil:"For investors with high risk tolerance and strong long-term conviction, this mode treats very low risk as high-conviction opportunities to front-load capital. It is lumpier and demands patience and liquidity, but aims to maximize Bitcoin acquired in the most favorable windows.",
  bs_cons_m0:"Normal weekly buy \u2014 business as usual", bs_cons_m1:"Mild boost when risk starts to look attractive", bs_cons_m2:"Clear value zone \u2014 double down", bs_cons_m3:"Rare, high-conviction buying opportunity",
  bs_mod_m0:"Bank the money \u2014 wait for better value", bs_mod_m1:"Buy zone \u2014 deploy 3\u00d7 base", bs_mod_m2:"Strong accumulation \u2014 4\u00d7 base", bs_mod_m3:"Maximum aggression \u2014 5\u00d7 base",
