  sim_d:"Each path starts from the model's last price and evolves with a GBM-style process whose drift comes from the hybrid model. Shocks are correlated across price and on-chain metrics via Cholesky decomposition. Pick a scenario and hit run.",
  sim_paths:"Paths", sim_horizon:"Horizon", sim_onchain:"On-chain metrics", sim_run:"Run simulation", sim_running:"Simulating…",
