  sim_note:"The <b>median</b> is the central trajectory; the <b>mean</b> sits far above it because the distribution is log-normal with a heavy upper tail (a few extreme paths drive it up). The &gt;3&sigma; stress share grows with the horizon and number of steps. On-chain series illustrate the <i>correlation structure</i>, not forecasts of their levels. Not financial advice.",
